 * A {@link OperatorStreamStateHandle} that works for file merging checkpoints. Besides the delegate
 * state handle for the operator state, it also carries the task-owned and shared managed directory
 * handles. These directory handles are registered to the {@link SharedStateRegistry} so that the
 * managed directories are maintained on the filesystem until they are no longer referenced by any
 * active checkpoint.
